e"}, "name": "send_wire", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "The Borealis Freight invoice is paid by wire.\n\n- **Invoice:** INV-87392, approved, due 2026-11-04\n- **Amount:** $5,591.20 (paid in full)\n- **Payment ID:** PAY0001\n- **Rail:** Wire, status \"sent\"\n\nVendor V-157 is bank-verified and supports wire, so ACH was not needed. The amount is under the $10,000 threshold, so no controller approval was required. I sent the wire once, using an idempotency key so it cannot be executed twice.\n\nThe other two Borealis invoices were left alone: INV-72904 is already paid, and INV-97492 ($3,387.63) is still a draft awaiting approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}